 "text": "Hey there, how are you? January is braver than some people realize. How much snow do you expect? Sure, go ahead. So, few inches you can handle, and there's always cafes if it really hits. Are you going solo, or with a group? Then look at him for support rather than worrying. Pick a lean to with a large door that opens out onto the snow. Sleep under the tent if the weather turns. Inches of snow are easy to remove until it snows heavily. Heavier snow can be scooped out rather than pushed,",
